**候签定理 5.96(五阶整数递推的模 31 零指标排除)**〔open;落 `D5/S1/Recurrence/SkolemOrderFiveModularExclusion`〕。设 a_0,…,a_4 为整数,`(a_0,…,a_4) ≡ (1,0,0,1,0) (mod 2)`;设整数序列 u 满足 `u_{n+5} = ∑_{i<5} a_i u_{n+i}`(Mathlib `LinearRecurrence.IsSolution`),且 `(u_0,…,u_4) ≡ (1,0,0,0,0) (mod 2)`。则对一切 n,若 `n % 31 ∉ {1,2,3,4,6,8,12,15,16,17,23,24,27,29,30}` 则 `u_n` 为奇数;特别地 `u_n = 0 → n % 31 ∈ {1,2,3,4,6,8,12,15,16,17,23,24,27,29,30}`。

